      "title": "Ebola outbreak death toll exceeds 5,000 in DR Congo",
      "source": "Qazinform",
      "link": "https://qazinform.com/news/ebola-outbreak-death-toll-exceeds-5000-in-dr-congo-6390f8",
      "date": "2026-10-31T16:48:06.000Z",
